# Freelens AI

## Overview

Freelens AI is an intelligent Operations AI Agent for freelance agencies.

The AI manages company knowledge, freelancer information, client history, contracts, project details, and operational workflows.

Unlike traditional chatbots, every interaction is stored inside Hindsight, allowing the agent to continuously improve its understanding of the business.

Hindsight is the ONLY persistent storage for conversational memory and long-term organizational knowledge.

---

# Goal

Build an AI Operations Assistant capable of remembering everything about a freelance company.

The assistant should:

- Understand freelancer profiles
- Remember client requirements
- Track project history
- Store contracts
- Recall previous conversations
- Learn company workflows
- Answer questions using long-term memory
- Reduce manual searching across documents

---

# Core Principle

Hindsight is the only memory database.

DO NOT create custom memory databases.

DO NOT store long-term memories in PostgreSQL, MongoDB, Redis, SQLite, or JSON files.

Every important interaction MUST be written into Hindsight.

Every retrieval MUST first query Hindsight.

